Pre-registration v2 (stage 4), frozen before any stage-4 run: replication on 20 fresh test worlds, model families (cross-family writer switches, E1 with other families as writer and reader, reader swaps), five more native memory systems with documented label predictions, a construct check where the writer model writes the executable derivation, and LLM-rendered worlds; budget and cut order; model roles and native integration contract logged in decisions.md first

